---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="연락처 | AI Insights" description="AI Insights 블로그에 대한 문의사항이 있으시면 연락주세요.">
	<div class="flex flex-col min-h-screen">
		<!-- Header -->
		<header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
			<div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 h-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<a href="/" class="p-2 -ml-2 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">arrow_back</span>
					</a>
					<h1 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white truncate">연락처</h1>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- Content -->
		<main class="flex-1 max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full px-4 py-8">
            <article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
                <h1>연락처</h1>
                
                <h2>문의 안내</h2>
                <p>AI Insights 블로그에 대한 문의사항, 제안, 오류 신고 등은 아래 이메일로 연락해 주세요.</p>
                
                <div class="not-prose bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 my-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">mail</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">이메일</p>
                            <a href="mailto:sarada0909@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline text-sm">sarada0909@gmail.com</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2>연락 가능한 사항</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>콘텐츠 관련</strong> — 기사 내용 오류, 수정 요청, 추가 정보 제공</li>
                    <li><strong>제휴 문의</strong> — 콘텐츠 협업, 광고 문의</li>
                    <li><strong>기술 문의</strong> — 사이트 버그 신고, 기능 제안</li>
                    <li><strong>저작권</strong> — 저작권 관련 문의 및 DMCA 요청</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>응답 안내</h2>
                <p>모든 문의에 대해 영업일 기준 2-3일 이내 답변 드리겠습니다. 감사합니다.</p>
            </article>
		</main>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full px-4 py-6 mb-16 text-center border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 border-dashed">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
                <a href="/about" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">소개</a>
                <span>|</span>
                <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">연락처</a>
                <span>|</span>
                <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">개인정보 처리방침</a>
                <span>|</span>
                <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">이용약관</a>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-600 mt-4">© {new Date().getFullYear()} AI Insights. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>

		<!-- Bottom Navigation -->
		<nav class="sticky bottom-0 z-50 flex gap-2 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark px-4 pb-4 pt-2 shadow-[0_-4px_6px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
			<a class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-primary transition-transform cursor-pointer hover:scale-105" href="/">
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined hover:fill-[1]">home</span>
				<p class="text-[10px] font-medium leading-normal uppercase tracking-wider">Home</p>
			</a>
			<button onclick="window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'})" class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-primary transition-transform cursor-pointer hover:scale-105">
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_up</span>
				<p class="text-[10px] font-medium leading-normal uppercase tracking-wider">Top</p>
			</button>
		</nav>
	</div>
</Layout>
